SUMMARY:City of Davis Wetlands Tour
DESCRIPTION:The Davis Wetlands is a managed\, native California wetland ecosystem that includes oak riparian woodlands and native grasslands. The group will caravan along the hard-packed gravel roads of the auto tour route. Several stops will be made along the way providing guests with a closer look at the many species of birds that utilize the more than 400 acres of reconstructed wetlands. \nMeet at the City of Davis Wastewater Treatment Plant. 45400 County Rd 28H\, Davis\, CA 95616. There is no access to restrooms in the City of Davis Wetlands; please arrange for this before arriving. Tours run rain or shine at 9:00 a.m. on the first Sunday of each month\, except in the instances of flooding. Registration required.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/city-of-davis-wetlands-tour/2026-11-01/
LOCATION:45400 County Road 28H\, Davis\, CA\, 45400 County Road 28H\, Davis\, 95616\, United States
END:VEVENT
